# Purpose

This document defines the dashboard engineering standards for the hubIO platform.

Its purpose is to ensure every dashboard provides a clear operational overview, supports rapid decision-making, and enables users to identify priorities without unnecessary exploration.

---

# Scope

This standard defines:

* Dashboard philosophy
* Operational information hierarchy
* Decision-oriented presentation
* Dashboard composition
* Role-based dashboard principles
* Dashboard governance

It intentionally excludes visual styling, component implementation, chart libraries, responsive implementation, and framework-specific techniques, which are defined by their respective Engineering Standards.

---

# Constitutional Interpretation

This document extends the hubIO Engineering Constitution.

It applies constitutional engineering principles to operational dashboards, ensuring every dashboard communicates meaningful business information while remaining scalable, understandable, and aligned with the overall product architecture.

